trDescription":"Unlocked 20 treasure chests.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/2844850/2edae1c6dc3bb0d2cf34f4fe0d2efd2e1cbc0891.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":31.799999237060547,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"AC15","strName":"King of Jewels","strDescription":"Obtained over 50 different jewels.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/2844850/bbc8f3bbf384cf947790a9d6426c31cb650db89b.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":28,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"AC08","strName":"Seeker of Strength","strDescription":"Unlocked 100 Growth Map slots.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/2844850/2edae1c6dc3bb0d2cf34f4fe0d2efd2e1cbc0891.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":27.600000381469727,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0}],"vecAchievedHidden":[],"nTotal":29,"nAchieved":0}}],["achievementmap",{"version":5,"data":"[]"}],["usernews",{"version":5,"data":[]}],["gameactivity",{"version":5,"data":[]}],["associations",{"version":2,"data":{"rgDevelopers":[{"strName":"Mistwalker Corporation","strURL":null}],"rgPublishers":[{"strName":"Square Enix","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/publisher/squareenix"}],"rgFranchises":[]}}],["descriptions",{"version":1,"data":{"strFullDescription":"[h2]■ New Gameplay Features[/h2]\r\n[list][*]Watch the characters and story come to life, with newly added English and Japanese voice overs.\r\n[*]Additional difficulty option allows players to switch between Normal and Hard difficulty. \r\n[*]Experience the world of FANTASIAN with new 4K resolution options.\r\n[*]Collaboration BGM – Switch the battle music from the original soundtrack to various songs from titles in the FINAL FANTASY franchise. [/list]\r\n*4K resolution is not supported in certain scenes of the game.\r\n\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844850/extras/822d61c48e04726cb2d5ab57fc2e10fa.poster.avif?t=1751340059\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844850/extras/822d61c48e04726cb2d5ab57fc2e10fa.webm?t=1751340059\" width=\"616\" height=\"346\"][/imgvid]\r\n\r\nThe Father of FINAL FANTASY, Hironobu Sakaguchi, and renowned composer Nobuo Uematsu return to deliver an original RPG story.\r\n\r\nMechteria—a deathly mechanical infection that robs humans of their emotions and lives—is slowly engulfing the world.\r\n\r\nThe protagonist Leo awakens with only one memory left to him in a strange land abundant with machines.\r\n\r\nThe human world, threatened by mechteria... a machine world, filled with mysteries... and the unseen dimensions that lie beyond both.\r\n\r\nUsing the Warp Device that was left behind, Leo must now embark on an interdimensional journey to reclaim his lost memories and save the world from the mechteria infection.\r\n\r\n[h2]■ Battles[/h2]\r\nThe key to battle is to manipulate skill trajectories. Draw in as many enemies as you can to efficiently defeat them all! \r\n[img width=\"616\" height=\"346\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844850/extras/d8fdc5f0bcac50520e480e25a468efd3.avif?t=1751340059[/img]\r\nYou’ll face all kinds of unique, powerful foes with a whole range of tricks at their disposal. \r\n[img width=\"616\" height=\"346\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844850/extras/c70c22e6b228148c4964321f65bea5be.avif?t=1751340059[/img]\r\n[h2]■ Field areas [/h2]\r\nEncounter a myriad of quests and uncover hidden items in the over 150 beautiful field areas that blend handmade dioramas with CG graphics.\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844850/extras/fe8cf902d5288b3d70d62a394d590bb2.poster.avif?t=1751340059\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844850/extras/fe8cf902d5288b3d70d62a394d590bb2.webm?t=1751340059\" width=\"616\" height=\"346\"][/imgvid]","strSnippet":"Embark on an adventure to discover your memories and save the world from a mechanical infection. Maneuver your skill trajectories during battle, and dive into a new dimension with a unique twist on a classic RPG experience."}}]]